{
  "name": "03b - Adapter: Exception Queue",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 03b - Adapter: Exception Queue\n\n**Swap point for the AP exception desk.**\n\nEvery invoice the pipeline refuses to post lands here with the\nmachine-readable reasons that caused the refusal, so a human can\nwork the queue instead of hunting through execution logs.\n\n`stage` records where it broke: `extraction`, `validation`, or\n`approval_rejected`.\n\nDemo sink: Data Table `ap_exceptions`. To go live, replace the\nsingle node `Raise ap_exceptions Row`:\n\n| Target | Node |\n| --- | --- |\n| Jira / ServiceNow | Jira -> Issue -> Create |\n| Zendesk | Zendesk -> Ticket -> Create |\n| Email to AP desk | Gmail / Send Email |\n| Slack triage channel | Slack -> Message -> Send |\n\n`reasons` is a JSON-encoded string array - it renders straight\ninto a ticket body or an alert without further parsing.",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 440,
        "color": 3
      },
